Altitude PRO is a necessary APP for outdoor travel and reaching people. It has powerful and accurate GPS positioning function. It allows you to get the information of current position, such as altitude, GPS position, air pressure, longitude and latitude coordinates in real time at the fastest speed. It also has built-in compass function. It will be a necessary real-time altitude measuring application for outdoor activities. For example: hiking, walking, skiing, rock climbing, mountain biking, hiking, mountain climbing, weather, compass, camping, outdoor, backpack, flight altitude and so on.

【Characteristic function】
1. Altitude meter: real-time altitude measurement, without network can accurately measure the location of altitude and longitude and latitude;
2. Compass: The built-in compass function allows you to get the direction and latitude information of your location more quickly.
3. Map navigation: support to view the map function, coordinates and elevation information of the current location and display on the map;
4. GPS positioning: GPS real-time positioning, making altitude measurement information faster and more accurate;
5. Watermarking camera: Watermarking photography is supported. The altitude, air pressure, longitude and latitude information of the photograph will be recorded by watermarking.


